{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>布甸狗Fans注意！適逢布甸狗30週年，日本7-Eleven即日起推出聯乘活動，除了3款造型甜品（忌廉牛奶布甸、白銅鑼燒、今川燒），購買指定商品更可獲贈限定周邊，得意又實用。</p><p>大抽獎同步登場，布甸狗屁屁背囊、今川燒造型抱枕＋毛毯Fans必抽！</p><p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令 recipients 念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884732161053756_17677895066a9fa4d9dc8af.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884732312831413_11716543086a9fa4db543fb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884732500977055_16388552516a9fa4dd20933.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884732640016063_15282025386a9fa4df213b3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884732847653300_13256324556a9fa4e0e273d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884733026564323_16410395606a9fa4e266565.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884733167438584_19117338686a9fa4e40131f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178884733297648800_7197942896a9fa4e549ffb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p><p>Tags : 711jp 7elevenjp IG精選 便利店食堂</p><p>圖片來源：@seven_eleven_japan／@sanrio_official_jp 資料或影片來源： Gotrip IG</p><p>Sep 8 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T06:19:12.947626+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":395,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}